// Every layout keeps the full one-cell border: rows 0 and 63 and columns 0
// and 63 are wall, since a missing border cell would be a one-pixel exit
// into off-grid space. arena.Validate refuses an open border, and
// TestPackFitsTheArena runs it over this pack.
//
// The play order is the pack order: levels.go's upcomingLevel walks 1 to 6
// and wraps back to 1.

pack walls

legend
  . floor
  # wall

// Level 1 — nothing but the border. The opening arena, and the only
// layout whose whole interior is safe-start territory.

level "OPEN ARENA"
